<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Music — Botaki Ba Afrika</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --cream: #EEF0C4;
    --yellow: #F3B417;
    --orange: #E97C2C;
    --brown: #5A2A0C;
    --green: #163C0A;
    --ink: #171512;
    --muted: #6B6858;
    --card-gray: #C9C9C4;
    --white: #FDFDF8;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Lemon Milk';
    src: url('/fonts/LemonMilk.woff2') format('woff2'),
         url('/fonts/LemonMilk.woff') format('woff');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Lemon Milk';
    src: url('/fonts/LemonMilk-Bold.woff2') format('woff2'),
         url('/fonts/LemonMilk-Bold.woff') format('woff');
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Lemon Milk';
    src: url('/fonts/LemonMilk-ExtraBold.woff2') format('woff2'),
         url('/fonts/LemonMilk-ExtraBold.woff') format('woff');
    font-weight: 800;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Avernire Medium';
    src: url('/fonts/Avernire-Medium.woff2') format('woff2'),
         url('/fonts/Avernire-Medium.woff') format('woff');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Avernire Medium', Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 { font-family: 'Lemon Milk', Arial, sans-serif; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  img, .ph { display: block; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }

  /* ---------- HEADER (shared) ---------- */
  header { background: var(--ink); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; }
  .header-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; position: relative; }
  .brandmark { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--white); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .brandmark svg { width: 32px; height: 32px; }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; }
  .nav-link { color: var(--white); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .nav-link.is-active { color: var(--yellow); }
  .nav-d { background: var(--orange); color: var(--white); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .nav-cta { background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .menu-toggle { display: none; background: none; border: none; color: var(--white); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; }
  .nav-item { position: relative; }
  .nav-item .caret { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-right: 2px solid currentColor; border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor; transform: rotate(45deg); margin-top: -3px; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
  .nav-item:hover .caret, .nav-item.open .caret { transform: rotate(225deg); margin-top: 3px; }
  .nav-dropdown {
    position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; margin-top: 16px;
    background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px;
    min-width: 180px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(8px);
    transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease, visibility 0.18s;
  }
  .nav-item:hover .nav-dropdown, .nav-item.open .nav-dropdown { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }
  .nav-dropdown a { display: block; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ink); }
  .nav-dropdown a:hover { background: var(--cream); }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .nav-links {
      display: none; position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0;
      background: var(--ink); flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 20px 32px; gap: 4px;
    }
    .nav-links.nav-open { display: flex; }
    .nav-item { width: 100%; }
    .nav-item .nav-link { width: 100%; padding: 10px 0; justify-content: space-between; }
    .nav-dropdown { position: static; opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: none; box-shadow: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); width: 100%; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .nav-dropdown a { color: var(--white); }
    .nav-dropdown a:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    .menu-toggle { display: block; }
  }

  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 2px; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } .mu-page * { animation: none !important; } }

  /* =========================================================
     MUSIC PAGE — namespaced under .mu-page
  ========================================================= */
  .mu-page .section { padding: 64px 0; }

  /* ---- hero ---- */
  .mu-page .mu-hero { padding: 72px 0 48px; }
  .mu-page .mu-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .mu-page .mu-eyebrow {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--yellow);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .mu-page .mu-title {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .mu-page .mu-title .hl { color: var(--yellow); }
  .mu-page .mu-hero-copy p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; max-width: 400px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .mu-page .mu-stat-row { display: flex; gap: 28px; }
  .mu-page .mu-stat .num { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; }
  .mu-page .mu-stat .label { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  /* spinning vinyl mark */
  .mu-page .vinyl-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .mu-page .vinyl {
    width: 280px; height: 280px; border-radius: 50%;
    background:
      repeating-radial-gradient(circle, rgba(253,253,248,0.06) 0px, rgba(253,253,248,0.06) 1px, transparent 2px, transparent 6px),
      var(--ink);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    animation: spin 14s linear infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 50px -18px rgba(23,21,18,0.45);
  }
  .mu-page .vinyl-label {
    width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--yellow);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    text-align: center; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .mu-page .vinyl-label span { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .mu-page .vinyl-hole { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink); margin-top: 4px; }
  @keyframes spin { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

  /* ============================================================
   DONATE MODAL
   ============================================================ */
.donate-modal-overlay {
  display: none;
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(23, 15, 5, 0.65);
  backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
  z-index: 1000;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 24px;
}
.donate-modal-overlay.is-open { display: flex; }
.donate-modal {
  position: relative;
  background-color: var(--white);
  background-image: url("/Resources/Info%20Tab%20Bg%20Design/Design%201.svg");
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-position: center center;
  background-size: cover;
  border: 3px solid var(--white);
  border-radius: 16px;
  max-width: 480px;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 32px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  animation: event-modal-pop 0.25s ease;
  max-height: 90vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
}
.donate-modal-close { position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 16px; background: none; border: none; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1; color: var(--brown, #5A2A0C); cursor: pointer; }
.donate-modal-eyebrow { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 13px; color: var(--orange, #E97C2C); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.donate-modal h3 { font-family: 'Lemon Milk', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--brown, #5A2A0C); }
.donate-modal-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px; }

.donate-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); padding: 4px; border-radius: 999px; }
.donate-tab { flex: 1; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: none; background: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink); transition: all 0.2s ease; }
.donate-tab.active { background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); }

.donate-panel { display: none; }
.donate-panel.active { display: block; }
.donate-info-box { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(23, 21, 18, 0.1); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.donate-label { display: block; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--green, #163C0A); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.donate-details { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--brown, #5A2A0C); line-height: 1.5; }
.donate-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px; }
.donate-list { padding-left: 18px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); }
.donate-list li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
.donate-cta { width: 100%; text-align: center; margin-top: 8px; }

 /* ---- statement strip ---- */
.mu-page .mu-statement {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  background-color: var(--ink);
  background-image: url("/Resources/Backgrounds/Banner%20BG%20Orange.svg");
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  color: var(--white);
}
.mu-page .mu-statement::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.75); /* translucent so the SVG shows through */
}
.mu-page .mu-statement > * {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.mu-page .mu-statement .wrap { padding: 56px 32px; }
.mu-page .mu-statement p {
  font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px);
  line-height: 1.4;
  max-width: 760px;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.mu-page .mu-statement .mu-sign { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--yellow); }
  
/* ---- tracklist (signature element) ---- */
  .mu-page .mu-gallery-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 28px; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .mu-page .mu-gallery-head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; max-width: 360px; }

  .mu-page .tracklist { background: var(--orange); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
  .mu-page .track-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 32px 44px 1fr auto auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23,21,18,0.08);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .mu-page .track-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .mu-page .track-row:hover,
  .mu-page .track-row:focus-visible {
    background: rgba(23,21,18,0.10);
  }
  .mu-page .track-row:hover .play-btn {
    background: var(--ink);
  }
  .mu-page .track-row:hover .play-btn svg {
    fill: var(--yellow);
  }
  .mu-page .track-num { font-size: 13px; color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; }
  .mu-page .play-btn {
    width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--yellow); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .mu-page .play-btn svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; fill: var(--white); margin-left: 2px; transition: fill 0.15s ease; }
  .mu-page .track-info h3 { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white)}
  .mu-page .track-info .track-artist { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--white); margin-top: 2px; }
  .mu-page .waveform { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2px; height: 24px; width: 90px; }
  .mu-page .waveform span { width: 3px; background: var(--yellow); border-radius: 2px; }
  .mu-page .track-tag {
    font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; height: fit-content;
    background: rgba(243,180,23,0.18); color: var(--brown);
  }
  .mu-page .track-dur { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--white); min-width: 34px; text-align: right; }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .mu-page .mu-hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .mu-page .vinyl-wrap { order: -1; }
    .mu-page .vinyl { width: 200px; height: 200px; }
    .mu-page .track-row { grid-template-columns: 24px 38px 1fr auto; }
    .mu-page .waveform { display: none; }
  }

  /* ---- artist spotlight ---- */
  .mu-page .spotlight {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr; gap: 44px; align-items: center;
    background: var(--white); border-radius: 18px; padding: 44px;
  }
  .mu-page .spotlight .ph { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--card-gray); }
  .mu-page .spotlight .sp-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .mu-page .spotlight h3 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .mu-page .spotlight p.bio { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .mu-page .spotlight p.sp-quote { font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; border-left: 3px solid var(--yellow); padding-left: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .mu-page .spotlight { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 28px; } }

  /* ---- join CTA ---- */
  .mu-page .mu-cta {
    background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 18px; padding: 44px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;
  }
  .mu-page .mu-cta h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; max-width: 460px; }
  .mu-page .mu-cta p { font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.85; max-width: 420px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .mu-page .btn { padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .mu-page .btn-dark { background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); }

/* ---------- FOOTER (shared) ---------- */
footer {
  position: relative;
  background-color: var(--ink);
  background-image: url('/Resources/Backgrounds/Footer%20BG%20Orange%202.svg');
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  color: var(--white);
}
footer::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(23, 21, 18, 0.85); /* keeps footer text/links readable over the SVG */
}
footer > * {
  position: relative; /* lifts footer content above the ::before overlay */
}
.footer-top { padding: 56px 0 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
.footer-brand-col .flogo { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.footer-brand-col p { color: rgba(253,253,248,0.6); font-size: 13px; max-width: 240px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.footer-social { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
.footer-social a { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.footer-social svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; fill: var(--white); }
.footer-col span.topic { display: block; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--yellow); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
.footer-col a { display: block; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.footer-col .contact-line { display: block; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.footer-map { margin-top: 8px; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
.footer-map iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 220px; border: 0; }
.footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); padding: 20px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(253,253,248,0.6); }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
@media (max-width: 520px) { .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--yellow); outline-offset: 2px; }
</style>

<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/Resources/Logo/Iconmark/BBA%20Logo%20Icon%20Orange(%23F48030).svg" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/Resources/Logo/Iconmark/BBA%20Logo%20Icon%20Orange(%23F48030).svg" />
</head>
<body class="mu-page">

<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a href="/" class="brandmark1" aria-label="Botaki Ba Afrika">
      <img src="/BBALogoWhite.svg" alt="Botaki Ba Afrika" width="100" height="90" />
    </a>
    <nav>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/src/pages/index.astro" class="nav-link">Home</a>

        <a href="/src/pages/disciplines.astro" class="nav-link" aria-current="page">Disciplines</a>
        
        <div class="nav-item">
          <a href="#tracklist" class="nav-link">Sounds <span class="caret"></span></a>
          <div class="nav-dropdown">
            <a href="#tracklist">Current Tracks</a>
            <a href="#spotlight">Artist Spotlight</a>
            
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#join" class="nav-cta">Contact</a>
      <a href="#donate" class="nav-d" id="donate-open-btn">Donate</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="section mu-hero">
    <div class="wrap mu-hero-grid">
      <div class="mu-hero-copy">
        <div class="mu-eyebrow">Botaki Ba Mmino — Music</div>
        <h1 class="mu-title">Rhythm carries<br>what words <span class="hl">can't</span>.</h1>
        <p>Botaki Ba Mmino is the musical engine of Botaki Ba Afrika , a dynamic department dedicated to nurturing musical talent, driving industry knowledge, and creating platforms where artists can perform, grow, and thrive. Rooted in both performance and professional development, this department exists to build a sustainable ecosystem for musicians within our community.</p>
        <div class="mu-stat-row">
          <div class="mu-stat"><div class="num">14</div><div class="label">Artists</div></div>
          <div class="mu-stat"><div class="num">32</div><div class="label">Tracks released</div></div>
          <div class="mu-stat"><div class="num">8</div><div class="label">Live sessions / yr</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vinyl-wrap">
        <div class="vinyl">
          <div class="vinyl-label">
            <span>Botaki</span>
            <div class="vinyl-hole"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== STATEMENT STRIP ===== -->
  <section class="mu-statement">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>"A song is a room you build for other people to sit in. Ours have space for everyone who's ever been left out of one."</p>
      <div class="mu-sign">— Music Circle, Botaki Ba Afrika</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== TRACKLIST ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="tracklist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="mu-gallery-head">
        <div>
          <h2 class="eyebrow" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">Current Tracks</h2>
          <p>A running playlist from the collective's musicians pulled from recent releases and live-session recordings. Tap a track to listen on Spotify or YouTube.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tracklist">
        <a class="track-row" href="https://open.spotify.com/track/REPLACE_ME_1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Listen to Amandla Groove by Zanele Mahlangu">
          <div class="track-num">01</div>
          <div class="play-btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="track-info"><h3>Amandla Groove</h3><div class="track-artist">Zanele Mahlangu</div></div>
          <div class="waveform"><span style="height:40%"></span><span style="height:70%"></span><span style="height:100%"></span><span style="height:55%"></span><span style="height:80%"></span><span style="height:35%"></span><span style="height:65%"></span><span style="height:90%"></span><span style="height:45%"></span><span style="height:60%"></span></div>
          <div class="track-tag">Single</div>
          <div class="track-dur">3:42</div>
        </a>
        <a class="track-row" href="https://open.spotify.com/track/REPLACE_ME_2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Listen to Township Lullaby by Themba Dlamini">
          <div class="track-num">02</div>
